  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A weapon you touch becomes a mastercraft weapon. Choose one of the following damage types: acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder. For the duration, the weapon has a +1 bonus to attack rolls and deals an extra 1d4 damage of the chosen type when it hits.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you use this creation using a creation slot of 4th level, the bonus to attack rolls increases to +2 and the extra damage increases to 2d4. When you use a creation slot of 6th level or higher, the bonus increases to +3 and the extra damage increases to 3d4.</p>",
